## Introduction

MedSync Health, Inc. ("MedSync," "we," "us," or "our") is committed to protecting the privacy of personal information. This policy describes how we collect, use, share, and protect personal information.

---

## Scope

This policy applies to:
- Personal information collected from customers
- Protected Health Information (PHI) processed on behalf of customers
- Employee personal information
- Website visitors and prospective customers
- Business partners and vendors

---

## Definitions

| Term | Definition |
|------|------------|
| Personal Information (PI) | Information identifying or relating to a natural person |
| Protected Health Information (PHI) | Health information as defined by HIPAA |
| Data Subject | Individual whose data is processed |
| Data Controller | Entity determining purposes of processing |
| Data Processor | Entity processing data on controller's behalf |
| Processing | Any operation performed on personal data |

