## Data Retention

### Retention Periods

| Data Category | Retention Period | Basis |
|---------------|------------------|-------|
| Customer Account Data | Contract term + 7 years | Legal requirement |
| PHI (for customers) | As directed by customer | BAA |
| Employee Data | Employment + 7 years | Legal requirement |
| Website Analytics | 2 years | Legitimate interest |
| Marketing Data | Until consent withdrawn | Consent |
| Support Tickets | 3 years | Legitimate interest |
| Security Logs | 7 years | Legal/compliance |

### Deletion Procedures

| Step | Process |
|------|---------|
| Request | Validated request received |
| Verification | Identity confirmed |
| Processing | Data located and deleted |
| Confirmation | Written confirmation provided |
| Exceptions | Legal holds, regulatory requirements |

